                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models with this ability which have a Damage Table are considered to have double the number of wounds remaining for the purposes of determining what those characteristics are.</characteristic>
