                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your Command phase. Select one TRAITORIS LEGIO TITANICA VEHICLE model from your army. Until the start of your next Command phase, that model is considered to have its full wounds remaining for the purposes of determining what characteristics on its profile to use.</characteristic>
