                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem at the beginning of your Movement phase. Select one TRAITORIS LEGIO TITANICA VEHICLE model from your army. Until the end of that phase, double the number of attacks made due the God-engine stride ability.</characteristic>
